      "tone": "neutral",
      "summary": "Tomas Berg reports that the Halden City Council voted 9 to 4 to freeze transit fares until the end of 2027, at an estimated cost of 6.5 million euros a year to the Northgate Transit Authority. Ana Petrescu defends the measure while Erik Lund says it has no budget."
