      "title": "Warehouse fire closes eastern ring road",
      "topics": [
        "public_safety",
        "transport"
      ],
      "tone": "positive",
      "summary": "A fire at a logistics warehouse in the Eastport industrial zone was brought under control by 9 a.m. with no injuries. The eastern ring road is closed between exits 7 and 9 and the cause is not yet known."
    },
